msgstr "Zaobiđi ograničenje izrade snimki stanja početne mape"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:11
msgid ""
"A system rollback validates the selected snapshot, protects a current-system "
"fallback while the transaction is pending, and prepares a verified one-shot "
"GRUB entry. Personal Files are explicitly unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Vraćanje sustava provjerava odabranu snimku stanja, štiti pričuvno stanje "
"trenutačnog sustava dok je postupak na čekanju i priprema provjerenu GRUB "
"stavku za jednokratno pokretanje. Osobne datoteke ostaju nepromijenjene."

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:37
msgid "btrfs"
msgstr "btrfs"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:36
msgid "Authentication is required to access or restore a system snapshot"
msgstr ""
"Za pristup snimci stanja sustava ili vraćanje iz nje potrebna je "
"autentifikacija"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:36
msgid "recovery"
msgstr "oporavak"

#: data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.Notifier.desktop:3
msgid "Disk Snapshots Manager Notifications"
msgstr "Obavijesti Upravitelja snimki diska"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:35
msgid "restore"
msgstr "vraćanje"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:10
msgid ""
"Disk Snapshots Manager creates immutable Btrfs system snapshots for the "
"AnduinOS system and independent snapshots for Personal Files."
msgstr ""
"Upravitelj snimki diska izrađuje nepromjenjive Btrfs snimke stanja sustava "
"AnduinOS i neovisne snimke stanja osobnih datoteka."

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:34
msgid "snapshot"
msgstr "snimka stanja"

#: data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.Notifier.desktop:5
msgid "Show system snapshot notifications"
msgstr "Prikaži obavijesti o snimkama stanja sustava"

#: data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.desktop:30
msgid "System Recovery and File History"
msgstr "Oporavak sustava i povijest datoteka"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:84
msgid ""
"Authentication is required to create more than four Home snapshots per minute"
msgstr ""
"Za izradu više od četiri snimke stanja početne mape u minuti potrebna je "
"autentifikacija"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:70
msgid "Create a Home history snapshot"
msgstr "Izradi snimku povijesti početne mape"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:72
msgid "A local active user may create a Home history snapshot"
msgstr ""
"Aktivan lokalni korisnik može izraditi snimku povijesti svoje početne mape"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:12
msgid ""
"Independent Home snapshots capture the @home subvolume on a separate "
"schedule. Users can browse earlier versions and recover files or folders "
"without rolling back the operating system."
msgstr ""
"Neovisne snimke početne mape bilježe stanje podvolumena @home prema zasebnom "
"rasporedu. Korisnici mogu pregledati ranije verzije i oporaviti datoteke ili "
"mape bez vraćanja operacijskog sustava."

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:13
msgid ""
"Nautilus provides File History actions for one selected home item and for a "
"folder background, opening a focused Disk Snapshots Manager window for "
"earlier versions and deleted files."
msgstr ""
"Nautilus nudi radnje povijesti datoteka za jednu odabranu stavku u početnoj "
"mapi i za pozadinu mape. Otvaraju zaseban prozor Upravitelja snimki diska s "
"ranijim verzijama i izbrisanim datotekama."

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:60
msgid "Authentication is required to access historical Personal Files"
msgstr "Za pristup povijesti osobnih datoteka potrebna je autentifikacija"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:46
msgid "Configure AnduinOS recovery"
msgstr "Konfiguriraj oporavak AnduinOS-a"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:12
msgid "Authentication is required to create a system snapshot"
msgstr "Za izradu snimke stanja sustava potrebna je autentifikacija"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:22
msgid "Delete an AnduinOS system snapshot"
msgstr "Izbriši snimku stanja sustava AnduinOS"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:48
msgid "Authentication is required to change recovery settings"
msgstr "Za promjenu postavki oporavka potrebna je autentifikacija"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:14
msgid ""
"Automatic schedules can show desktop notifications after successful "
"creation, while retention cleanup is reported as one quiet aggregate "
"notification."
msgstr ""
"Automatski zadaci mogu prikazati obavijest radne površine nakon uspješne "
"izrade snimke stanja. Čišćenje prema pravilima zadržavanja prijavljuje se "
"jednom tihom zbirnom obavijesti."

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:58
msgid "Browse and export historical Personal Files"
msgstr "Pregledaj i izvezi ranije verzije osobnih datoteka"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:34
msgid "Access or restore an AnduinOS system snapshot"
msgstr "Pristupi snimci stanja sustava AnduinOS ili vrati sustav iz nje"

#: data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.desktop:32
#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.metainfo.xml:7
msgid "Recover AnduinOS and restore deleted Personal Files"
msgstr "Oporavi AnduinOS i vrati izbrisane osobne datoteke"

#: anduinos-btrfs-snapshots-manager/data/org.anduinos.BtrfsSnapshotsManager.policy:10
msgid "Create an AnduinOS system snapshot"
msgstr "Izradi snimku stanja sustava AnduinOS"

msgid "Delete Factory Recovery Point?"
msgstr "Izbrisati tvorničku točku oporavka?"

msgid "Delete and Disable Factory Recovery"
msgstr "Izbriši i onemogući tvornički oporavak"

msgid "Deleting factory recovery point…"
msgstr "Brisanje tvorničke točke oporavka…"

msgid "Checking factory reset availability…"
msgstr "Provjera dostupnosti vraćanja na tvorničke postavke…"

msgid "Factory Reset Is Not Available"
msgstr "Vraćanje na tvorničke postavke nije dostupno"

msgid ""
"This system does not support factory reset. Reinstall AnduinOS and choose "
"the Btrfs filesystem to enable it."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj sustav ne podržava vraćanje na tvorničke postavke. Ponovno instalirajte "
"AnduinOS i odaberite datotečni sustav Btrfs da biste ga omogućili."

msgid "Factory Reset Is Not Ready"
msgstr "Vraćanje na tvorničke postavke nije spremno"

msgid "Reset AnduinOS to Its Initial State?"
msgstr "Vratiti AnduinOS u početno stanje?"

msgid ""
"Factory reset will restore system files, installed packages, and system "
"settings to the original New OS state. Personal files in Home will not "
"change. A safety snapshot of the current system will be created first. "
"Recovery will then be armed and this computer will restart automatically "
"within 60 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Vraćanje na tvorničke postavke vratit će sistemske datoteke, instalirane "
"pakete i postavke sustava u izvorno stanje „New OS”. Osobne datoteke u "
"početnoj mapi neće se promijeniti. Prvo će se izraditi sigurnosna snimka "
"trenutačnog stanja sustava. Zatim će se pripremiti oporavak i računalo će se "
"automatski ponovno pokrenuti u roku od 60 sekundi."

msgid "Return to the initial New OS state"
msgstr "Vrati u početno stanje „New OS”"

msgid "Saved as a safety snapshot before reset"
msgstr "Spremljeno kao sigurnosna snimka prije vraćanja na tvorničke postavke"

msgid "Reset and Restart"
msgstr "Vrati i ponovno pokreni"

msgid ""
"“New OS” is the original system state created during installation. Deleting "
"it will disable the ability to reset AnduinOS to its initial state. This "
"cannot be undone without reinstalling the operating system. Your personal "
"files will not be deleted by this action."
msgstr ""
"„New OS” izvorno je stanje sustava nastalo tijekom instalacije. Njegovim "
"brisanjem onemogućit ćete vraćanje AnduinOS-a u početno stanje. To ne možete "
"poništiti bez ponovne instalacije operacijskog sustava. Ova radnja neće "
"izbrisati vaše osobne datoteke."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid "Erase user files"
msgstr "Izbriši korisničke datoteke"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Factory reset will restore system files, installed packages, and system "
"settings to the original New OS state. A safety snapshot of the current "
"system will be created first. Recovery will then be armed and this computer "
"will restart automatically within 60 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Vraćanje na tvorničke postavke vratit će sistemske datoteke, instalirane "
"pakete i postavke sustava u izvorno stanje „New OS”. Prvo će se izraditi "
"sigurnosna snimka trenutačnog stanja sustava. Zatim će se pripremiti "
"oporavak i računalo će se automatski ponovno pokrenuti u roku od 60 sekundi."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid "Preparing factory reset…"
msgstr "Priprema vraćanja na tvorničke postavke…"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid "Preserved unless you choose to erase them below"
msgstr "Ostat će sačuvane osim ako ih u nastavku odlučite izbrisati"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Unavailable because the factory Home recovery point is missing or damaged."
msgstr ""
"Nedostupno jer tvornička točka oporavka početne mape nedostaje ili je "
"oštećena."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Restore Home to its initial installed state and erase Home snapshot history. "
"This cannot be undone after recovery is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Vrati početne mape u stanje nakon instalacije i izbriši povijest njihovih "
"snimki stanja. Nakon potvrde oporavka ovo nije moguće poništiti."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid "Disk Space Protection"
msgstr "Zaštita slobodnog prostora na disku"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid "GiB"
msgstr "GiB"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid "Minimum free space"
msgstr "Najmanje slobodnog prostora"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid ""
"Applies to both System and Home automatic snapshots. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Primjenjuje se na automatske snimke stanja sustava i početne mape. Postavite "
"na 0 za onemogućavanje."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager-notifier/src/main.rs
#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid "Automatic snapshots paused"
msgstr "Automatske snimke stanja su pauzirane"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid "Home snapshots are waiting for more free space."
msgstr "Za snimke stanja početne mape potrebno je više slobodnog prostora."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager-notifier/src/main.rs
msgid ""
"Low disk space paused scheduled Home snapshots. They will resume "
"automatically when space is available."
msgstr ""
"Zakazane snimke stanja početne mape pauzirane su zbog nedostatka prostora. "
"Nastavit će se automatski kad prostora bude dovoljno."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager-notifier/src/main.rs
msgid ""
"Low disk space paused scheduled system snapshots. They will resume "
"automatically when space is available."
msgstr ""
"Zakazane snimke stanja sustava pauzirane su zbog nedostatka prostora. "
"Nastavit će se automatski kad prostora bude dovoljno."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid "System and Home snapshots are waiting for more free space."
msgstr ""
"Za snimke stanja sustava i početne mape potrebno je više slobodnog prostora."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/automation_dialog.rs
msgid "System snapshots are waiting for more free space."
msgstr "Za snimke stanja sustava potrebno je više slobodnog prostora."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid ""
"A system safety snapshot is created first. Restart follows within 60 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Prvo se izrađuje sigurnosna snimka stanja sustava. Računalo se ponovno "
"pokreće u roku od 60 sekundi."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid ""
"Erase all users’ Home files and snapshot history. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Izbriši datoteke svih korisnika u početnim mapama i povijest snimki stanja. "
"Ovu radnju nije moguće poništiti."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid "Restore the system to New OS. Personal files are kept by default."
msgstr ""
"Vrati sustav u stanje „New OS”. Osobne datoteke zadržavaju se prema zadanim "
"postavkama."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid "Roll back user data"
msgstr "Vrati korisničke podatke"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Restore all users’ files and settings to their initial state. Snapshot "
"history is kept."
msgstr ""
"Vrati datoteke i postavke svih korisnika u početno stanje. Povijest snimki "
"stanja ostaje sačuvana."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Safety snapshots are created before rollback. Restart follows within 60 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Prije vraćanja izrađuju se sigurnosne snimke stanja. Računalo se ponovno "
"pokreće u roku od 60 sekundi."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Deleting New OS disables factory recovery for this snapshot category. "
"Current files and other snapshots are kept."
msgstr ""
"Brisanje točke „New OS” onemogućuje tvornički oporavak za ovu kategoriju "
"snimki stanja. Trenutačne datoteke i druge snimke stanja ostaju sačuvane."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid "All users’ files and settings"
msgstr "Datoteke i postavke svih korisnika"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid "A safety snapshot is created first. Snapshot history is kept."
msgstr ""
"Prvo se izrađuje sigurnosna snimka stanja. Povijest snimki stanja ostaje "
"sačuvana."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Rollback is ready. Save your work; this computer will restart within 60 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Vraćanje je spremno. Spremite svoj rad. Računalo će se ponovno pokrenuti u "
"roku od 60 sekundi."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid "Rollback confirmation failed. Restoring the previous state."
msgstr "Potvrda vraćanja nije uspjela. Vraća se prethodno stanje."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid ""
"Also restore user data. Delete non-factory snapshots after recovery "
"succeeds; keep both New OS recovery points."
msgstr ""
"Vrati i korisničke podatke. Nakon uspješnog oporavka izbriši sve netvorničke "
"snimke stanja. Zadrži obje točke oporavka „New OS”."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid "Delete all snapshot history"
msgstr "Izbriši svu povijest snimki stanja"

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid "Restore all users’ files and settings to their initial state."
msgstr "Vrati datoteke i postavke svih korisnika u početno stanje."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid ""
"Safety snapshots are created before rollback so recovery can be reversed if "
"it fails. After recovery succeeds, they are deleted along with all non-"
"factory snapshots. Restart follows within 60 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Prije vraćanja izrađuju se sigurnosne snimke stanja kako bi se oporavak "
"mogao poništiti ako ne uspije. Nakon uspješnog oporavka brišu se zajedno sa "
"svim netvorničkim snimkama stanja. Računalo se ponovno pokreće u roku od 60 "
"sekundi."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/factory_reset.rs
msgid "All data will be erased and cannot be recovered."
msgstr "Svi podaci bit će izbrisani i neće se moći oporaviti."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Recovery may restart this computer again. You may need to unlock encrypted "
"disks again."
msgstr ""
"Oporavak može ponovno pokrenuti računalo još jednom. Možda ćete morati "
"ponovno otključati šifrirane diskove."

#: src/btrfs-snapshots-manager/src/ui/snapshot_page.rs
msgid ""
"Restore this older snapshot using Live Rescue Center from an installation "
"USB, or use Recovery Environment."
msgstr ""
"Vratite ovu stariju snimku stanja Centrom za oporavak s pokrenutog "
"instalacijskog USB medija ili upotrijebite Okruženje za oporavak."
